sequenceDiagram
  participant C as Client
  participant A as API
  participant D as SQLite
  participant J as Job queue
  participant W as Web page
  C->>A: POST /ingest {type, content or url}
  A->>A: validate (zod), SSRF check for URLs
  A->>D: insert item, status = processing
  A-->>C: 202 {item}
  A->>J: enqueue job
  J->>W: fetch and extract text (URLs only)
  J->>J: chunk, then embed
  J->>D: store chunks and vectors, status = ready (or failed + reason)
  loop while any item is processing
    C->>A: GET /items?status=processing (every 1.5 s)
  end
